  "id": "vsCode",
  "name": "VS Code",
  "sources": [
    "VS Code Dark Modern / Light Modern (Dark+ / Light+ token colors): microsoft/vscode extensions/theme-defaults/themes/dark_plus.json, dark_vs.json, light_plus.json, light_vs.json",
    "Go as the Go extension (golang/vscode-go) shows it with gopls semantic tokens on (ui.semanticTokens): namespace and type (also int, string: type.defaultLibrary) teal, function and method yellow / brown, parameter, variable and field light blue / navy, readonly variable (const, nil, true) bright blue",
    "Directives, //go:build lines and comment references are plain comments; a struct tag is a raw string"
